OL,3,GNEWSABirmingham Christmas Market 2026:
OL,4,AWhat you need to know
OL,5,
OL,6,FBirmingham Frankfurt Christmas Market
OL,7,Fopens on Thursday, heralding the start
OL,8,Fof the festive season in the city
OL,9,Fcentre.
OL,11,FDozens of stalls will be selling
OL,12,Ftraditional food and drink including
OL,13,Fschnitzel and bratwurst, as well as
OL,14,Fhandcrafted gifts, decorations and
OL,15,Fjewellery.
OL,17,FHere is a round-up of information to
OL,18,Fhelp plan your visit and what you can
OL,19,Fexpect from this year's market.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
