OL,3,GNEWSABirmingham Christmas Market 2026:
OL,4,AWhat you need to know
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe size of the event makes the market
OL,7,Fhard to miss in Birmingham city centre
OL,8,Fwith stalls and entertainment on offer
OL,9,Fin Victoria Square and New Street,
OL,10,Fbetween Corporation Street and the
OL,11,FBullring.
